<!--Post: 5885--><!--Time: 1107443550-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5885"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Wilmac<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Wilmac<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 03, 2005 - 7:12 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I don&#39;t know if anyones noticed this before, but I thought I&#39;d post it and see what people thought. <BR> <BR>The last press conference, Landwehr&#39;s voice sounded familiar. So I loaded the press conference on one window and BTK&#39;s call on the other. <BR> <BR>The voices are VERY similar. I mean REALLY similar. <BR> <BR>Has he ever been suspected? Could there be a PD coverup? <BR> <BR>Just a thought, but the voices are incredibly alike.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5885-->
<!--Post: 5946--><!--Time: 1107461529-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5946"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Doom<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Doom<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 03, 2005 - 12:12 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Most likely he has been cleared by a DNA test but I do not know for certain if he has been.  To toss a log on your fire take a look at this.... <BR> <BR><a href="http://www.crimelibrary.com/graphics/photos/serial_killers/unsolved/btk/police-sketch.jpg" target=_top>http://www.crimelibrary.com/graphics/photos/serial _killers/unsolved/btk/police-sketch.jpg</a> <BR> <BR><a href="http://www.crimelibrary.com/graphics/photos/serial_killers/unsolved/btk/6-Landwehr.jpg" target=_top>http://www.crimelibrary.com/graphics/photos/serial _killers/unsolved/btk/6-Landwehr.jpg</a> <BR> <BR>Doom<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5946-->
<!--Post: 5948--><!--Time: 1107461775-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5948"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Elsewhere<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Elsewhere<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 03, 2005 - 12:16 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->...THAT tossed a log on my fire... <BR>THANKS DOOM <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5948-->
<!--Post: 5952--><!--Time: 1107464195-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5952"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Doom<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Doom<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 03, 2005 - 12:56 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->You are very welcome Elswhere.  I am currently attempting to get information regarding whether or not he has been cleared by a DNA test. <BR> <BR>Doom<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5952-->
<!--Post: 6796--><!--Time: 1108009928-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6796"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Doom<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Doom<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, February 09, 2005 - 8:32 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Unfortunately I still have not received a yes or no answer.  Can anyone verify whether or not Mr. Landwehr has been cleared by DNA?  Thanks. <BR> <BR>Doom <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6796-->
<!--Post: 6846--><!--Time: 1108045633-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6846"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Skiller<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Skiller<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 10, 2005 - 6:27 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->LT Llandwehr looks like he could be a very mean person I think if a ran into him on the streets, I would turn around and go the other way. after all he has been calling all the shots on the BTK murders.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6846-->
<!--Post: 6848--><!--Time: 1108048589-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6848"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Featherw<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Featherw<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 10, 2005 - 7:16 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Llandwehr a MEAN person?  I would have thought just the opposite.  But...you may have a point Skiller.  <BR> <BR>Does look like he has been calling all the shots.  Does Llandwehr have a BROTHER by any chance?  Thanks...<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6848-->
<!--Post: 6851--><!--Time: 1108050092-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6851"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Skiller<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Skiller<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 10, 2005 - 7:41 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Featherw   dont know if he has a brother,he could be a gentle person. he just looks mean<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6851-->
<!--Post: 6859--><!--Time: 1108052343-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6859"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Newyorker<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Newyorker<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 10, 2005 - 8:19 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->hmm...maybe that&#39;s why BTK wasn&#39;t caught for so long, he was working on the inside.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6859-->
<!--Post: 7287--><!--Time: 1108365278-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7287"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Glad<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Glad<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, February 13, 2005 - 11:14 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->My feeling all along is that he has been close to the investigation. Possibly in the police department or in related areas like City Hall, Fire Department, Coroners office, etc. I still think he moved away, continued his crimes elsewhere like in Texas or California and then came back.  If the postings in the BTK speaks are him then it appears that he is telling us that we are not looking close enough to the center of things.  <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 7287-->
<!--Post: 7889--><!--Time: 1108736669-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7889"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Berkeley_street<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Berkeley_street<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 18, 2005 - 6:24 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I am not saying that it is Lt. Llandwehr but there is a few things that make you wonder. First, the space in the teeth. second, his voice does sound very much like the recording. And like BTK said, we were not looking close enough to the center of things. Who is in the center of this???? Does anyone else agree. Also, does anyone know the history on him, age, marital status, how long he has worked for the department, etc.. <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 7889-->
<!--Post: 7947--><!--Time: 1108763094-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7947"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:nugzter@yahoo.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Nugzter<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Nugzter<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 18, 2005 - 1:44 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I like the Landwehr  brother theory. But hard to believe. I would turn my bro in if I knew he was a SK. I love my family, but there is a civil responsibility. Landwehr is a cop. Come on. I have changed my mind on WPD not releasing the evidence. They are doing pretty good I bet. When it all comes out in the end, alot of people who slagg WPD will be eating their words.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 7947-->
<!--Post: 8197--><!--Time: 1108974769-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8197"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Doom<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Doom<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, February 21, 2005 - 12:32 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->It is kind of funny...not funny ha ha but funny strange how people do not look at the obvious and over analize to the point they are lost in their own details. ;&#41;   <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 8197-->
<!--Post: 8198--><!--Time: 1108974989-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8198"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Doom<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Doom<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, February 21, 2005 - 12:36 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Fact. Our boy is giving back his trophies after decades...what do you think that means? Has that ever happened before in any serial murder case? <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 8198-->
<!--Post: 8236--><!--Time: 1109011193-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8236"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Dsv<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Dsv<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, February 21, 2005 - 10:39 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK has to prove to LE that he really is BTK. The trophies he is returning help prove it.  <BR> <BR>Unless, of course, someone else or an accomplice has his trophies and is just playing games with LE as a hoax if BTK is no longer living. <BR> <BR>I disagree that LE has clean hands with respect to BTK and LE knows that BTK knows this.  <BR> <BR>Off topic: <BR> <BR>According to the 2000 census there are only approximately 4800 non-black males living in Wichita between the age of 60 - 65. <BR> <BR>Yet LE states they have narrowed the list to 4000.  In fact, I recall somewhere that they stated they have swabbed 4000. <BR> <BR>However, I doubt this because I think a DNA test costs about $1000 to $1500 per test &#40;if they have swabbed 4000 suspects that about $5 millions dollars&#41;. I doubt they have spent $5 million swabbing suspects.  Resources could be spent better elsewhere trying to solve the crime. <BR> <BR>My point is that the list of licensed drivers in year 1974 compared to the current list of licensed drivers in Wichita in this age group &#40;60 - 65&#41; I doubt is close to 4000. Why? <BR> <BR>Persons licensed on 74 are no longer licensed now because they have moved, and persons licensed now probably weren&#39;t licensed in 1974 because have moved to Wichita. These facts should reduce the list significantly of the total 4800 suspects.  <BR> <BR>So just exactly is LE doing to narrow their list of 4000 suspects? <BR> <BR>The way I see it just about every non-black male in this age group is still a suspect according to LE.  <BR> <BR>But the number 4000 LE resports is good spin...as it suggests a list of 4000 is harder to narrow down than a list of a hundred.  <BR> <BR>The truth or &#40;no spin on the facts&#41; is that the list starts at 4800 &#40;males in the 60-65 age group&#41;. <BR> <BR>I think a group of college kids could be better to narrow the list of suspects. <BR> <BR>This story if it is ever solved will be huge. It will will make the OJ trials seem insignificant. <BR> <BR>It surprises me that the private sector hasn&#39;t stepped in with funds to help solve the case, since the return on investment would be huge if they could get a percentage of the story. <BR> <BR>There are a lot of players in this story and each will have a book or a movie.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 8236-->
<!--Post: 8452--><!--Time: 1109136919-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8452"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Doom<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Doom<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, February 22, 2005 - 9:35 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Let&#39;s brain storm for a minute.  I agree BTK is proving to LE it is really him by giving back his trophies but my point is no serial killer in the history of serial killers has ever done this before.  Not once before this case.  There is obviously a direct or indirect connection to LE.  <BR> <BR>Doom <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 8452-->
<!--Post: 9849--><!--Time: 1109659449-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9849"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Doom<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Doom<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, February 28, 2005 - 10:44 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Looks like he did have a LE connection. ;&#41;  <BR> <BR>Doom <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 9849-->
